{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30310","headline":"昔昔盐二十首 空梁落燕泥 · 赵嘏","name":"昔昔盐二十首 空梁落燕泥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春至今朝燕，花时伴独啼。\n飞斜珠箔隔，语近画梁低。\n帷卷闲窥户，牀空暗落泥。\n谁能长对此，双去复双栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}